ster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/97e065a0f2d55572a944cf278a406b75.poster.avif?t=1559339803\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/97e065a0f2d55572a944cf278a406b75.webm?t=1559339803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/97e065a0f2d55572a944cf278a406b75.mp4?t=1559339803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A single match only takes a few minutes, but Mowin' &amp; Throwin' can keep you and your friends occupied for seasons. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/2bdaa077437b921af0b687e3fd676935.poster.avif?t=1559339803\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/2bdaa077437b921af0b687e3fd676935.webm?t=1559339803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/2bdaa077437b921af0b687e3fd676935.mp4?t=1559339803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The controls and objective of Mowin' &amp; Throwin' are easy to learn. But if you want to be a cut above the rest, you'll need to master each lawn's unique challenge to turn them to your advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762030/extras/6a489a3251037969477463db4eaa6400.avif?t=1559339803\" width=616 height=310 /></span><br>Each lawn is unique and creates challenges that affect how you mow and throw. Some examples include shifting terrain, elevators, destructible environments, darkness, and more!",
